                       <a class="more-active netsolution-a fontHM" href="https://www.edan.com/services/7.html" "="">Learn More<span></span></a>
                            
                    </div>

                    <div class="netsolution-itemtxt">
                        <p class="netsolution-itemp1">Risk control procedures throughout the product life cycle to ensure that network security risks are correctly identified and prevented during equipment design, production and clinical use</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">Program interactivity designed in strict compliance with IHE standards, supporting information integration based on standard message formats such as HL7, DICOM and GDT</p><p><br></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(146, 208, 80);"><a href="https://www.edan.com/services/14.html" target="_self" title="Compatible EMR Vendors" _href="/services/14.html" style="color: rgb(146, 208, 80); text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(146, 208, 80);">|</span></a></span><a href="https://www.edan.com/services/14.html" target="_self" title="Compatible EMR Vendors" _href="/services/14.html">&nbsp;&nbsp;<b style="font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;; color: rgb(126, 186, 0); font-size: 22px;">Compatible EMR Vendors&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="./Services-page_files/6379591204031229018846698.png" title="expand icon.png" _src="/Uploads/ueditor/image/20220812/6379591204031229018846698.png" alt="expand icon.png"></b></a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
