                    <div class="netsolution-itemtit">
                        <h3>Technical Support</h3>

                        <h4 class="fontHL">
                            With our localized service network, we are dedicated to keep closer to the customer and work together as a high-performance system.
                        </h4>

                        
                    </div>

                    <div class="netsolution-itemtxt">
                        <p class="netsolution-itemp1">Professional Service Staff</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">Service Case Recording &amp; Tracing System</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">Quick Spare Parts Dispatching</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">Remote &amp; On-Site Technical Support</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">24-hour Response</p>
