                <div class="netsolution-itemv clearfix">
                    <div class="netsolution-itemtit">
                        <h3>Training</h3>

                        <h4 class="fontHL">
                            EDAN provide a professional, flexible, comprehensive training system for our customer.
                        </h4>

                        
                    </div>

                    <div class="netsolution-itemtxt">
                        <p class="netsolution-itemp1">Headquarters Training, get a chance to first-hand information of our product in the Headquarter.</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">Subsidiary Company Training, visit the nearest subsidiary company for training at their convenience.</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">On-site Training, offer a face-to-face training to the customer around the world.</p><p class="netsolution-itemp1">Remote Training, easily attend the training via Internet.</p>
